            "text": "Friendly and engaging team player and leader able to inspire staff to perform their best. Detail oriented and experienced restaurant manager passionate about food and beverages. A multi-tasker who excels at staff training and recruiting with a track record of inspiring great customer service and customer satisfaction. Regularly exceed sales goals. A master in the art of upselling.",
